@startuml state-task
!include _style.iuml
title Task lifecycle (BR-08, TaskStateMachine)
[*] --> ASSIGNED : assignReport / reassignTask
ASSIGNED --> ACCEPTED : accept [assignee]
ACCEPTED --> IN_PROGRESS : start [assignee]
IN_PROGRESS --> COMPLETED : complete [notes ≥10, 1–3 proofs,\nstill the report's active task]
ASSIGNED --> REASSIGNED : reassign
ACCEPTED --> REASSIGNED : reassign
IN_PROGRESS --> REASSIGNED : reassign
COMPLETED --> [*]
REASSIGNED --> [*]
@enduml
